    `under UN authority and control` IS FALSE
    `for international peace and security` IS TRUE
    `declared an exceptional risk` IS FALSE
    `for peacebuilding assistance` IS FALSE
    `for emergency humanitarian assistance` IS FALSE
    `a Chapter VII enforcement action` IS FALSE
    `UN workers engaged as combatants` IS FALSE
    `the law of international armed conflict applies` IS FALSE

`a Chapter VII combat operation under armed-conflict law` MEANS Operation WITH
    `established by a UN organ under the Charter` IS TRUE
    `under UN authority and control` IS TRUE
    `for international peace and security` IS TRUE
    `declared an exceptional risk` IS FALSE
    `for peacebuilding assistance` IS FALSE
    `for emergency humanitarian assistance` IS FALSE
    `a Chapter VII enforcement action` IS TRUE
    `UN workers engaged as combatants` IS TRUE
    `the law of international armed conflict applies` IS TRUE

`a Chapter VII enforcement action without combat` MEANS Operation WITH
    `established by a UN organ under the Charter` IS TRUE
    `under UN authority and control` IS TRUE
    `for international peace and security` IS TRUE
    `declared an exceptional risk` IS FALSE
    `for peacebuilding assistance` IS FALSE
    `for emergency humanitarian assistance` IS FALSE
    `a Chapter VII enforcement action` IS TRUE
    `UN workers engaged as combatants` IS FALSE
    `the law of international armed conflict applies` IS FALSE

`a Chapter VII combat operation outside armed-conflict law` MEANS Operation WITH
    `established by a UN organ under the Charter` IS TRUE
    `under UN authority and control` IS TRUE
    `for international peace and security` IS TRUE
    `declared an exceptional risk` IS FALSE
    `for peacebuilding assistance` IS FALSE
    `for emergency humanitarian assistance` IS FALSE
    `a Chapter VII enforcement action` IS TRUE
    `UN workers engaged as combatants` IS TRUE
    `the law of international armed conflict applies` IS FALSE

`a UN development project outside peacebuilding` MEANS Operation WITH
    `established by a UN organ under the Charter` IS TRUE
    `under UN authority and control` IS TRUE
    `for international peace and security` IS FALSE
    `declared an exceptional risk` IS FALSE
