§ `s 3(2) to (4) -- UN operation`

#ASSERT `the operation is a UN operation` `a peacekeeping mission`
#ASSERT `the operation is a UN operation` `a peacebuilding mission`
#ASSERT `the operation is a UN operation` `a mission declared an exceptional risk`
#ASSERT `the operation is a UN operation` `an emergency humanitarian mission`
#ASSERT NOT `the operation is a UN operation` `a coalition force not under UN control`
#ASSERT NOT `the operation is a UN operation` `a Chapter VII combat operation under armed-conflict law`
#ASSERT `the operation is a UN operation` `a Chapter VII enforcement action without combat`
#ASSERT `the operation is a UN operation` `a Chapter VII combat operation outside armed-conflict law`
#ASSERT NOT `the operation is a UN operation` `a UN development project outside peacebuilding`

#ASSERT NOT `the operation counts only by virtue of s 3(3)` `a peacekeeping mission`
#ASSERT `the operation counts only by virtue of s 3(3)` `a peacebuilding mission`

§ `s 3(1) -- UN worker`

#ASSERT `the person is a UN worker` `a member of a military, police or civilian component deployed by the Secretary-General` FALSE `a peacekeeping mission`
#ASSERT `the person is a UN worker` `a UN, specialised agency or IAEA official or expert on mission` TRUE `a peacekeeping mission`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a UN worker` `a UN, specialised agency or IAEA official or expert on mission` FALSE `a peacekeeping mission`
#ASSERT `the person is a UN worker` `deployed by a humanitarian NGO under an agreement with the UN` FALSE `a peacebuilding mission`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a UN worker` `deployed by a humanitarian NGO with no agreement with the UN` FALSE `a peacebuilding mission`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a UN worker` `a private contractor of a national government` TRUE `a peacekeeping mission`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a UN worker` `a member of a military, police or civilian component deployed by the Secretary-General` TRUE `a coalition force not under UN control`

